    "custom_rich_text_NRXcPr": {
      "type": "custom-rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_7fPaGe": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Three Decades Serving El Segundo With Intention</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "font_size_desktop": 48,
            "font_size_mobile": 32,
            "font_family": "Larken"
          }
        },
        "richtext_8TQDfK": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Colours, textures, and scents merge into arrangements that communicate beyond words. We source blooms from growers who meet our standards, ensuring each stem arrives at peak beauty. Ou<em>r flower shop in El Segundo CA</em> focuses on creating pieces that resonate emotionally, whether celebrating joy or offering comfort. This isn't about following trends, but it's about understanding what flowers mean to the people who give and receive them.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_7fPaGe",
        "richtext_8TQDfK"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".prose a {color: rgb(255, 42, 0) !important; font-weight: 800;}"
      ],
      "name": "Custom Rich Text",
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "",
        "separate_section_with_border": true,
        "content_width": "sm",
        "text_position": "center",
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_XNncP9": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_eHwm9R": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Farm-Direct Quality You Can See & Feel</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_XwQmzf": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Our commitment begins before arrangements take shape. Direct relationships with growers give us access to blooms at their freshest. We handle each stem with precision, maintaining ideal conditions from arrival to delivery.</p><p><strong>You'll Find:</strong></p><ul><li>Roses spanning classic to contemporary palettes</li><li>Tulips capturing spring's vibrant spirit</li><li>Wildflowers create effortless, natural beauty</li><li>Hydrangeas offer fullness and romance</li><li>Sunflowers radiate warmth instantly</li><li>Plus many more seasonal varieties!</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading_eHwm9R",
        "richtext_XwQmzf"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".prose a {color: rgb(255, 42, 0) !important; font-weight: 800;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "color_scheme": "",
        "color_scheme_inner": "scheme-4d8a7991-12ad-4ca0-8eb7-7f8f2837331e",
        "narrow_section": true,
        "remove_left_padding": false,
        "separate_section_with_border": false,
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Farm-Direct_Quality_You_Can_See_Feel.png",
        "mobile_image": "shopify://shop_images/Farm-Direct_Quality_You_Can_See_Feel.png",
        "reveal_on_scroll": true,
        "image_position": "start",
        "content_width": "sm",
        "remove_vertical_spacing": false
      }
    },
    "image_with_text_64f3Dj": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_fAaA7i": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": ""
          }
        },
        "heading_mW3fdR": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<strong>Collections Built Around Your Desire </strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h2"
          }
        },
        "richtext_8KGmgJ": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p>Generic doesn't work when the moment matters. Our custom design approach lets you shape the arrangement. Match your loved one's favorite shades, sizes that fit the occasion, and styles that reflect your relationship. We transform your vision into florals that feel personal and purposeful.</p><p><strong>Custom Design Options:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Wedding Florals:</strong> <a href=\"/collections/bouquet\" title=\"Bouquet\">Bridal bouquets</a>, ceremony backdrops, and table arrangements</li><li><a href=\"/collections/anniversaries\" title=\"Anniversaries\"><strong>Anniversary Gifts:</strong></a> Blooms expressing years of love</li><li><a href=\"/collections/birthday\" title=\"Birthday\"><strong>Birthday Bouquets:</strong> </a>Joyful designs celebrating another year</li><li><strong>Corporate Flowers:</strong> Polished arrangements for professional spaces</li><li><a href=\"/pages/sympathy\" title=\"Sympathy\"><strong>Sympathy Arrangements</strong></a><strong>:</strong> Gentle florals offering solace</li><li><strong>Seasonal Designs:</strong> Festive pieces for El Segundo holidays and gatherings</li></ul>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_fAaA7i",
        "heading_mW3fdR",
        "richtext_8KGmgJ"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
        ".prose a {color: rgb(255, 42, 0) !important; font-weight: 800;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
